      "writtenOn": "2024-03-18T03:05:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we shouldn\u0027t assume that the vendor will always return a configuration for our requirement and capability combination, since they might have different internal set of configurations.\n\nWe might need to ensure configuration is not empty before verification with a block of `if (!configurations.empty()) { ...`\n\nSame apply for `BluetoothAudioProviderLeAudioInputHardwareAidl::GetAseConfiguration_Multidirectional`",
