      "writtenOn": "2024-04-29T13:49:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "actually we do want to make sure that.\nI think we should add more test cases to cover all the context types.\n\nNote that capabilities are non empty.\n\n@tyszkowski@google.com what do you think?",
      "parentUuid": "eb68ab89_9b2ae245",
      "revId": "6d882e30ace912a5ef9afd619b8d711d04b05a22",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
