        "id": 1928988
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-04-29T15:09:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On one hand, It seems, that we should have some minimal set of requirements that would guarantee a valid configuration. The context type could be one of them and the 10ms interval for 16kHz used here is mandated by the BAP specification for the Unicast Audio server. But on the other hand I can imagine that the vendor might want to use the HW offloader just for a certain set of parameters, and would like to force the Software session as a fallback mechanism for other cases. We don\u0027t set to much requirements here. 16kHz and 10ms interval on remote sink direction seem really basic to me.",
      "parentUuid": "a5ebf2db_151789a1",
      "revId": "6d882e30ace912a5ef9afd619b8d711d04b05a22",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
